   "sourceHash": "883eae9d123e5f6fe394c2fd780b73dc67a34477a6c7e752f7c2f8ab4f17a07f",
   "text": "혈압 치료 – Rakta Samadama Chikitsa (락타 사마다마 치키트사)",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
